<div class="section_content content" id="7682893_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7682894"><a alt="231-11A" class="litem_number" href="7682894#7682894" onclick="return false;" title="231-11A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Buildings occupied in whole or in part as defined in this code shall comply with the requirements hereinafter set forth concerning occupancy, size, light and ventilation in order to provide safe and healthful environment.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7682895"><a alt="231-11B" class="litem_number" href="7682895#7682895" onclick="return false;" title="231-11B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The term "accessory use" shall have a uniform meaning and shall apply in the same manner and under the same conditions or restrictions to all residential buildings.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7682896"
